00:06:48.469 --> 00:06:54.349
Now, If you're anything like me, you already
know why I say that this story was the blueprint

00:06:54.349 --> 00:06:56.319
for modern Shounen anime.

00:06:56.319 --> 00:07:01.610
This character trope can be found in 9 out
of 10 shounen stories.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:06.889
The most obvious being of course Dragon Ball
and Son Goku, who literally is the anime version

00:07:06.889 --> 00:07:12.360
of Sun Wukong, at least until Dragon Ball
then starts going down a completely different

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.409
route later on.

00:07:14.409 --> 00:07:24.029
While Goku is known for his naivete and childish
nature, Goku also has a more serious and over-confident

00:07:24.029 --> 00:07:26.870
side as well, a trait shared by Sun Wukong.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:32.499
Goku’s eternal rival, Vegeta, can also be
seen as a more ruthless version of the demon

00:07:32.499 --> 00:07:37.259
companion Zhu Bajie, who is powerful but falls
behind the main hero in terms of strength

00:07:37.259 --> 00:07:38.360
and transformations.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:42.610
Naruto, is not a demon monkey, but a demon
fox child.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:48.289
His major redemption came with his victory
over Pain, a villain who is the literal embodiment

00:07:48.289 --> 00:07:51.189
of Buddha’s Paths of Reincarnation.

00:07:51.189 --> 00:07:55.949
Just like Sun Wukong, Naruto is able to create
clones of himself and even shape-shift into

00:07:55.949 --> 00:07:59.309
other living beings, like his infamous sexy
jutsu.

00:07:59.309 --> 00:08:04.819
His own “path to Buddhahood” cis also
reflected in his powers, first gaining access

00:08:04.819 --> 00:08:09.939
to his sage mode, then literally taming his
inner demon, before finally acquiring the

00:08:09.939 --> 00:08:17.909
Six Paths Sage Mode that gives Naruto an ungodly
amount of power.

00:08:17.909 --> 00:08:24.289
Which now finally brings me to One Piece and
Luffy and why his devil fruit might be Sun

00:08:24.289 --> 00:08:25.289
Wukong himself.

00:08:25.289 --> 00:08:28.689
By the way, if you enjoy this sort of content
and don't want to miss any of my weekly videos,

