00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.630
of the crew.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.300
So I know you probably already recognised
a lot of Luffy in what I've been telling you

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:43.940
about Sun Wukong, but let's go through all
the parallels we have in case you missed something.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.560
The first very obvious connection we have
is of course Luffy's name.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:52.680
He is Monkey D. Luffy who wants to become
the KING of pirates.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.650
Monkey King right there.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:58.290
Also Oda confirmed that Luffy would be a monkey
if he was an animal.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:04.110
Personality wise, Luffy perfectly fits the
kind, powerful, but often reckless and impulsive

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:14.530
nature of the monkey king.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:19.610
Only that instead of a world of demons, Luffy
lives in a world of pirates.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:24.899
Luffy's journey in the very first chapter
begins in the east blue making his way towards

00:09:24.899 --> 00:09:30.060
the west end of the grand line - which I found
such a sneaky detail honestly.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:35.180
In the very same chapter, Luffy eats his devil
fruit, just like sun wukong who ate the forbidden

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:39.839
fruit from the heavenly garden, that gives
him the ability to stretch and shrink, just

00:09:39.839 --> 00:09:41.580
like Sun Wukongs staff.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:44.170
All of that just in chapter one.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:48.839
From there Luffy sets out to find the one
piece, that contains the true history of the

00:09:48.839 --> 00:09:57.649
world, the sacred knowledge, just like the
sacred scrolls.

00:09:57.649 --> 00:10:01.160
He finds loyal companions that accompany him
on his journey.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:05.040
Just like the two demons from the journey
to the west, Luffy finds the ruthless Pirate

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:10.459
Hunter Zoro, who has the theme of the buddhist
demon ashura and rivals Luffy's own strength,

00:10:10.459 --> 00:10:12.920
though always being slightly behind him.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:18.000
As well as Sanji, who with his theme of the
devil, dibble, represents the second food

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:26.610
loving demon companion, that by the way also
has a thing for women.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:32.310
He also meets Nami, who not only wields a
size chaining staff, but also has acquired

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.720
Zeus, a cloud she can ride on.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:39.470
I personally think Oda really wanted to bring
these elements into the story, without making

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:42.900
it too obvious by giving them to luffy.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:47.080
Though we actually see Luffy using a staff
as a kid.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:52.209
Similarly to Sun Wukong, in the first half
of the story we see Luffy seemingly invincible

00:10:52.209 --> 00:10:57.519
beating every opponent he faces, no matter
how strong, using his indestructible body

00:10:57.519 --> 00:11:02.040
and will and his ability to transform his
body in crazy ways, as he beocomes more and

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:17.710
more infamous in the world of pirates, just
as the monkey king did in the world of demons.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:23.290
And just like sun wukong, Luffy seems to befriend
everyone around them, even though he previously

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.661
might have fought against them.

00:11:24.661 --> 00:11:29.600
The monkey king also gets help and favours
from many of the characters he previously

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.600
went against.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:36.199
The monkey king also has a weakness to smoke,
which seems to be represented by a character

00:11:36.199 --> 00:11:41.170
literally called Smoker, a marine with smoke
abilities, who keeps interfering with him

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.759
throughout the story.

00:11:42.759 --> 00:11:48.290
Luffy takes this all as a joyful game, where
he wins no matter what, always becoming stronger

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.950
and playfully conquering the grand line.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:12:00.440
He defeats the first God with Enel, who tries
to destroy him with lightning, just like the

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:04.329
gods tried and failed to destroy sun wukong
with lightning.

00:12:04.329 --> 00:12:10.080
Then on Enies Lobby, Luffy declares war on
the celestial dragons, heaven itself, even

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.889
punching Charlos on Sabaody.

00:12:11.889 --> 00:12:15.730
In the journey to the west, the heavens represent
Taoism.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:21.550
But since the author is a big advocator for
Buddhism, the Buddha is the true heavenly

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.620
force here.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:27.569
Similarly, the celestial dragons are not the
right gods for the one piece world, but someone

00:12:27.569 --> 00:12:33.360
like Luffy, who is on his way to enlightenment,
has to be the one to bring true piece to the

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.360
world.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:38.440
First however, just like Sun Wukong, Luffy
needs his moment of reckoning, as he is humbled

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.470
by the Buddha himself.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:45.220
This of course happens during Marineford,
Luffy's lowest point and biggest moment of

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:49.000
change, as I have discussed in past Luffy
videos.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:53.649
Luffy has to learn that his carelessness &amp; recklessness
has risked the life of his crew on Sabaody

00:12:53.649 --> 00:12:56.850
and has cost the life of his brother during
the war.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:04.210
And lust like Sun Wukong, he is literally
crushed under the hand of the Buddha []. Then

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:13.380
Akainu tries to burn him to ashes, like the
gods tried with Sun Yukon after using lighting,

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.060
but they fail again.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:20.660
And just like the monkey king, who was buried
under a mountain for a time to grow and contemplate,

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:25.019
Luffy puts his straw hat on this rock, to
train and grow for two years.

00:13:25.019 --> 00:13:30.570
It is from here, that Luffy becomes more thoughtful,
gets a more serious outlook on the world and

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:33.459
starts to develop significantly as a leader.

00:13:33.459 --> 00:13:38.690
Luffy picks up his journey again, now equipped
with a variety of new forms, that not only

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:45.680
have a very buddhist feel to them, but that
also have attacks inspired by animal names,

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:54.550
reflecting Sun Wukongs abilities to transform
into different animals and change his size.

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:55.550
Kong Gong?

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:56.550
huH!!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:14:02.029
One thing that had been missing about Luffy
is the theme of a deity or god, that Sun Wukon

00:14:02.029 --> 00:14:03.029
represents.

00:14:03.029 --> 00:14:07.439
However even that has changed during Wano,
where Luffy has now been linked to the sun

00:14:07.439 --> 00:14:14.509
god as well as the the wisdom king by Hyogoro
with Oda hinting at Luffy being a reincarnation

00:14:14.509 --> 00:14:18.579
or having inherited the will of the previous
god.

00:14:18.579 --> 00:14:22.231
And Luffy's journey will end with reaching
laugh tale and finding the one piece, which

00:14:22.231 --> 00:14:25.259
will enlighten him about the true nature of
the world.

00:14:25.259 --> 00:14:30.639
This will signify his rise to becoming a Buddha
and becoming the true god, that can strike

00:14:30.639 --> 00:14:33.449
down the false celestial dragons.

00:14:33.449 --> 00:14:38.410
And on top of this all there a lot more themes
from the journey to the west sprinkled throughout

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:39.410
the story.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.970
The existence of three-eyed people, that have
the ability of true sight.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:46.630
Sun Wukong defeating and sort of befriending
a dragon.

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:48.149
Let's see if that happens with Kaido.

00:14:48.149 --> 00:14:49.980
And much more.

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:52.641
Now all of this has been much more analysis
than theory.

00:14:52.641 --> 00:14:53.641
And I really hope you found this as fascinating
as I have.

00:14:53.641 --> 00:14:57.730
But now with all that being said, despite
the pirate king Monkey d Luffy being clearly

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:04.089
inspired by the Monkey king, why should his
devil fruit actually be the literal mythical

00:15:04.089 --> 00:15:05.630
model Sun Wukong?

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:10.880
And thank you to Winvill for sending me the
idea for this and who also drew the concept

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.089
for the thumbnail himself.

00:15:13.089 --> 00:15:14.820
What crazy talent.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:20.110
Okay so we've already seen that Oda connected
Luffy to Sun Wukong in the very first chapter

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:21.589
through the GOmu Gomu no mi.

00:15:21.589 --> 00:15:24.790
Eating a forbidden fruit that gives you powers,
Bla Bla.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.720
That would also explain why Luffy's fruit
might still give him a rubber body.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:33.540
With Oda basically giving Son Wukong's stretching
staff and shapeshifting abilities a twist

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:36.260
and uniting it in one power.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.610
Luffy is the staff if you like.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:43.209
And we even see him using his fruit to fly
though the sky like a cloud.

00:15:43.209 --> 00:15:45.610
So there.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:49.990
Now the basis of this theory that I was sent
is actually not The journey to the west at

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.550
all, but Momotaro.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:56.870
But I think everything we have talked about
already gives this theory way more credibility

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.870
now.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:04.310
So as we have discussed in countless videos
now, Momotaro is the inspiration for Wano.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:09.260
You have Momotaro, Momo, who has to take down
an One, Kaido.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:12.040
And he needs the help of three companions
to do so.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.180
A pheasant, a dog and a monkey.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:20.279
The reveal that really made this theory possible
is that of Yamato's mythical dog devil fruit.

00:16:20.279 --> 00:16:25.959
Because now we have the mythical zoan Devil
fruit user Kaido, the one, momo with the same

00:16:25.959 --> 00:16:31.410
mythical fruit, Yamato with a mythical Zoan,
and that leaves us with the pheasant and the

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.410
monkey.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:37.970
Now conveniently, we do have a mythical blue
bird on Wano with Marco.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:42.650
So, who could the monkey possibly be.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:43.650
Hmmm.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.060
You see what I'm getting at here?

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:50.310
Luffy is clearly the monkey in the Momotaro
story and all characters inspired by it have

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:56.589
eaten a mythical zoan devil fruit, except
Luffy, who has eaten something Oda calls a

00:16:56.589 --> 00:17:02.819
'special paramecia' that not only looks like
a buddist deity, but also gives Luffy the

00:17:02.819 --> 00:17:08.980
ability to transform his body in any way imaginable,
plus fire powers.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:13.959
And we now know that shanks went out of his
way to steal this fruit from the government.

00:17:13.959 --> 00:17:19.240
Plus, with Sengoku's buddha from the journey
to the west, we have another mythical zoan

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.970
fruit in the mix.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:26.130
Oh also, admittedly only in the anime, we
got this sketch from vegapunks lab, showing

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:30.600
what happens when you merge, what clearly
is luffy's devil fruit with a rocket.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:35.929
And as we know, objects only seem to be able
to consume zoan fruits.

00:17:35.929 --> 00:17:41.090
And so if the true awakening of Luffy's fruit
is actually the Monkey God Sun Wukong himself

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:46.010
with all his crazy powers, that would not
only connect him to Joy Boy, who might have

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:52.100
been its previous user, but also make Luffy
the literal embodiment of the deity that can

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.950
bring down the false gods.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:59.130
Of course there also other possible reasons
why the GOmu GOmu no mi might be special,

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:04.330
so I strongly recommend you check out this
video on why shanks stole it from the government

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.260
next.

